                            	  4875:     ; Animation frame 1 uses Wallmaster frame image 1, which
                            	  4876:     ; uses tiles $9C/$9D on the left and $9E/$9F on the right.
                            	  4877:     ; The right side is correctly the right side of a closed hand.
