02:0003A5A4 66F0            	  5480:     bne  _anon_z04_80
                            	  5481:     ; I don't know why the object timer of the tail segment that will
                            	  5482:     ; be made dead is set to $11. By setting its object type to $5D
                            	  5483:     ; below, its metastate will become $10 -- dying/dead. From
                            	  5484:     ; there, the object timer is set to 6.
                            	  5485:     ;
