                            	  2148: DrawStatusBarItemsAndEnsureItemSelected:
                            	  2149:     ; Draws the selected item and the sword in the status bar.
                            	  2150:     ; Before drawing the item, it ensures that SelectedItemSlot
                            	  2151:     ; refers to an occupied, equippable item slot.
                            	  2152:     ;
                            	  2153:     ; This accounts for the fallback behavior between potions
                            	  2154:     ; and letters and the two boomerangs.
                            	  2155:     ;
                            	  2156:     ; Start at slot zero. Normally, it would be used to
                            	  2157:     ; check swords. When it's used as the selected item index;
                            	  2158:     ; it's a pseudo-slot used for checking boomerangs.
                            	  2159:     ;
