                            	  5935: ; 4 sets of horizontal offsets, one for each state of weapon.
                            	  5936: ; Each set contains 4 offsets in reverse direction index order:
                            	  5937: ; up, down, left, right
                            	  5938: ;
                            	  5939: ; These offsets are added to player X to get weapon X.
